{'symbol': 'TPR', 'date': '2023-02-21 06:45:00', 'title': 'TAPESTRY, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TAPESTRY, INC. (NYSE: TPR), A LEADING NEW YORK-BASED HOUSE OF ICONIC ACCESSORIES AND LIFESTYLE BRANDS CONSISTING OF COACH, KATE SPADE, AND STUART WEITZMAN, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 27, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 10, 2023.'}